1 (35%)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Q5</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Test search&#x02013;all medical record reports</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02018;follicular lymphoma&#x02019;</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">193 (13%)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Q6</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">ICD-9 codes&#x02013;Emory Clinic</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">202.0, 202.00, 202.01, 202.02, 202.03, 202.04, 202.05, 202.06, 202.07, 202.08</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">901 (59%)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Q7</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">ICD-9 codes&#x02013;Emory Hospitals</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(same as Q6 above)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">288 (19%)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Q8</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Q2 + Q6</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(see criteria for Q2 and Q6 above)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1137 (74%)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Q9</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Q4 + Q6</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(see criteria for Q4 and Q6 above)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1233 (80%)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Q10</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Q1 + Q2</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(see criteria for Q1 and Q2 above)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">498 (32%)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Q11</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Text search&#x02013;pathology reports</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">(UMLS terms&#x02013;see <xref ref-type="table" rid="t3-cin-03-149">Table 3</xref>)</td><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">36 (2%)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Q12</td><td align="le